OL,3,GNEWSAPoppy Appeal could miss out on
OL,4,A#18k in donations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal British Legion said its
OL,7,Fannual Poppy Appeal in Suffolk could
OL,8,Fmiss out on about #18,000 of donations
OL,9,Fthis year due to a lack of volunteers.
OL,11,FSome areas of the county are still
OL,12,Fwithout a designated Poppy Appeal
OL,13,Forganiser, with the launch of the
OL,14,Fannual fundraising drive just weeks
OL,15,Faway, on 22 October.
OL,17,FMandi Cox-Osborne, Poppy Appeal manager
OL,18,Ffor Suffolk, fears the area may
OL,19,Fstruggle to contribute in the same way
OL,20,Fthis year as it has previously.
